<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1129_3643.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser fründtlich willig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dienst</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuovor</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fürnemen</unclear>
