<lb n="13"/>haben soll, ist doch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dasselbig</unclear> mitt unserm
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorwissen</unclear> gar nit, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darzuo</unclear> alls <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear>
